      <ExpenseAmt>274527</ExpenseAmt>
      <Desc>Birthlines San Diego location served over 1,100 low income pregnant women and families with young children. We impacted over 3,400 minor dependents for a total of over 4,500 unduplicated individuals. We provided diapers, formula, newborn essentials and other baby items as well as referrals for safe housing, food, medical and pre-natal care, county services, education, and employment. Birthline walks with families from conception to kindergarten. Clients are seen bi-monthly or as needed, creating oportunities to achieve milestones, receiving encouragement and accountability. Birthline offers clients solutions to immediate and emergency needs, the opportunity for stabilization and a chance to thrive as a family. Birthlines impact is unique.</Desc>
